  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.23 “Mixing machine” means a machine containing 75 numbered balls and a blower attachment blowing air on the balls to mix them up and randomly force one ball at a time up a chute to be drawn.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.20)",
